d future belongs to the pipeline and exposes its associated request.","The test invokes the actual pipelineDecode implementation with initialized replication state.","A controlled interface implementation may deliver a completed failed future; Consumer's contract does not restrict delivery to successful futures."],"excluded":["Proof that a built-in follower produces an error together with Success=true in a legal cluster history","Proof of incorrect commitment, application, or client completion","Full request-response correlation across network failures","Other transport variants and deployment activation","Shutdown and peer-replacement correctness beyond the exercised consumption boundary"],"parameters":{}},"check_ids":["5280bd5450a946138e4a74c18d705adc","dc625e465cc74edb8d1fdf0553800e16","0288e583f7ef460baad040da271276a9","6a3c2c032e014effb29299c27a9ecdf2"],"evidence_ids":["d49132ed2e634faf807896aa7b7730a8","a9d8d1e395d24a0a9dcb941625ce7638"],"current_result":{"outcome":"violated","bounded_complete":true,"confirmed":true,"blockers":[],"boundaries":["Proof that a built-in follower produces an error together with Success=true in a legal cluster history","Proof of incorrect commitment, application, or client completion","Full request-response correlation across network failures","Other transport variants and deployment activation","Shutdown and peer-replacement correctness beyond the exercised consumption boundary","Artificial failed-future response contents are controlled interface inputs; they are not evidence of a built-in producer emitting those fields.","The match-map comparison detects an effective progress update in this initialized state, not every possible invocation of commitment.match.","The Error marker is set immediately before its synchronous return; the controlled Error implementation has no blocking or intervening calls, and the decoder invokes the methods sequentially.","No observation here establishes incorrect commitment, application, client complet